# Charts — the REAL panel since app build 3 (14 Oct 2026): PpChartsPanel → PpChartsBody, objectName "chBody",
# on ScreenSessionMode and ScreenWrist (build/charts-build/STEP3.md). The body exposes `tab` (writable: shot |
# session | relations | kinds), `view` (the tab; forced to shot/session on a non-interactive cast), `shownView`
# (Kinds reads Session in Replay), `register`, `registerItem`, the reader's choices and openReading(id). FEED is
# the presenters' outputs as the body binds them once (t* = ChartsTracesPresenter, r* = ChartsRelationsPresenter):
# what a mock declares it reads, and what --dump writes.
# The try-out of the real panel: try.sh [--selftest] charts tools/typeset-harness/screens/charts_real.qml
# (a pass-through that checks each view, and opens/closes an "Apart from the session" row as the drill-in).
TARGET=chBody
PANEL_KEY=charts
FEED=tChoices,tShot,tRef,tSession,tNow,rStatus,rShot,rOpen,rRel,rKinds,rReplay
TAB_PROP=tab
VIEW_PROP=view
VIEWS=shot,session,relations,kinds
